5","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/article/coherent-lumentum-and-ciena-stocks-surge-on-bullish-wall-street-call-182906439.html","texto":null,"trechos":["Coherent (COHR) stock jumped 11%, while Lumentum (LITE) increased 7%.","Ciena (CIEN) gained 6%, and Arista (ANET) also rose after Bernstein called the group structural AI winners in a note initiating coverage with an Outperform rating.","\"Customers need complete optical solutions, not just individual components.\" As demand for AI compute grows, companies are looking to make data center connections faster and more energy-efficient than the copper wiring commonly used today.","In April, Goldman Sachs called optical networking \"the next mega trend in AI infrastructure,\" roughly a month after Nvidia (NVDA) announced a $4 billion investment in Coherent and Lumentum.","\"Along with an AI infrastructure ramp-up and rising computing power per rack, we expect all configurations to enjoy strong growth ahead, opening a further 9x TAM unlock to US$154bn,\" the Goldman Sachs team wrote.","Coherent stock has risen 72%, Lumentum 185%, Ciena 60%, and Arista 56% in 2026."],"hash_url":"U-ebc644e1f8","resumo":["Coherent (COHR) stock jumped 11%, while Lumentum (LITE) increased 7%.","Ciena (CIEN) gained 6%, and Arista (ANET) also rose after Bernstein called the group structural AI winners in a note initiating coverage with an Outperform rating.","\"Customers need complete optical solutions, not just individual components.\" As demand for AI compute grows, companies are looking to make data center connections faster and more energy-efficient than the copper wiring commonly used today.","In April, Goldman Sachs called optical networking \"the next mega trend in AI infrastructure,\" roughly a month after Nvidia (NVDA) announced a $4 billion investment in Coherent and Lumentum.","\"Along with an AI infrastructure ramp-up and rising computing power per rack, we expect all configurations to enjoy strong growth ahead, opening a further 9x TAM unlock to US$154bn,\" the Goldman Sachs team wrote.","Coherent stock has risen 72%, Lumentum 185%, Ciena 60%, and Arista 56% in 2026."],"id":"N-524a9cd1c6"},{"titulo":"Update: US Equity Indexes Rise as Treasury Yields Slide, Fed Rate-Increase Bets Fade Following Manufacturing, Labor Market Data","veiculo":"Yahoo Finance","url_veiculo":"https://finance.yahoo.com","publicado":"2026-10-01T18:19:53Z","descricao":"Update: US Equity Indexes Rise as Treasury Yields Slide, Fed Rate-Increase Bets Fade Following Manufacturing, Labor Market Data finance.yahoo.com","hash":"7bc4335f6b","ativos":["UST"],"severidade":"info","palavras":[],"consulta":"us_macro","lang":"en-US","licenca":"resumo","veiculo_id":"yahoo","gatilho":"macro","fontes_extras":[],"fonte_unica":true,"url_google":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPYnE0R3ZfWm50RXh3cnRIWDBSMGtvLVYxaWFsTjZjNkNGcXRrZkZGWHFqV1I0cldtWlFTRHJPMzNhcFZrNXFIYlJYUUZBZFJOLW51cGYyTVQzZDhFOEVJdWltTHJlc0pocjBlOGdzTkVWUzhRQjhkMHJQdUVVSG9odUVGY2FyVGZDbVpLZmxWd1pXcjc1ZkVPbjNXazQ?oc=5","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPYnE0R3ZfWm50RXh3cnRIWDBSMGtvLVYxaWFsTjZjNkNGcXRrZkZGWHFqV1I0cldtWlFTRHJPMzNhcFZrNXFIYlJYUUZBZFJOLW51cGYyTVQzZDhFOEVJdWltTHJlc0pocjBlOGdzTkVWUzhRQjhkMHJQdUVVSG9odUVGY2FyVGZDbVpLZmxWd1pXcjc1ZkVPbjNXazQ?oc=5","texto":null,"trechos":[],"resumo":["Update: US Equity Indexes Rise as Treasury Yields Slide, Fed Rate-Increase Bets Fade Following Manufacturing, Labor Market Data finance.yahoo.com"],"id":"N-7bc4335f6b"},{"titulo":"It's the Start of Uptober. Will Bitcoin Live Up to It?","veiculo":"Yahoo Finance","url_veiculo":"https://finance.yahoo.com","publicado":"2026-10-01T17:11:44Z","descricao":"It's the Start of Uptober. Will Bitcoin Live Up to It? finance.yahoo.com","hash":"9640332e4b","ativos":["BTC"],"severidade":"info","palavras":[],"consulta":"cripto","lang":"en-US","licenca":"resumo","veiculo_id":"yahoo","gatilho":"padrao","fontes_extras":[],"fonte_unica":true,"url_google